  1: # Scholar-Flow Copilot Instructions
  2: 
  3: ## Project Overview
  4: Scholar-Flow is an AI-powered research paper SaaS collaboration platform.
  5: - Next.js 16 App Router, React 19.2, TypeScript strict
  6: - better-auth for authentication (migrated from NextAuth.js v4)
  7: - Redux Toolkit Query for state management
  8: - Tailwind CSS + shadcn/ui
  9: - Express.js backend with Prisma + PostgreSQL
 10: - Turborepo v2.5.8 + Yarn Berry v4.9.2
 11: 
 12: ## Auth & Session
 13: - Auth config: `apps/frontend/src/lib/auth/better-auth.ts`
 14: - Auth client: `apps/frontend/src/lib/auth/authClient.ts`
 15: - API route: `apps/frontend/src/app/api/auth/[...auth]/route.ts`
 16: - proxy.ts handles auth guards (not middleware.ts)
 17: - Redux authSlice persists accessToken for backend API calls
 18: - OAuth: Google + GitHub via backend API
 19: 
 20: ## Backend Integration
 21: - All API calls go through RTK Query in `apps/frontend/src/redux/`
 22: - Backend base URL: `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL`
 23: - Auth endpoints: `POST /api/auth/signin`, `POST /api/auth/oauth/signin`
 24: - JWT tokens signed with `NEXTAUTH_SECRET` (also used by better-auth)
 25: 
 26: ## Code Style
 27: - Server Components by default; `"use client"` only when needed
 28: - Use `next/image` and `next/font`
 29: - OKLCH color system, `max-w-[1440px]` container
 30: - Use ToastProvider functions (not sonner directly)
 31: - All auth functions have try/catch with `ApiError`
 32: 
 33: ## Quality Gates
 34: 1. `yarn build` succeeds
 35: 2. `yarn type-check` clean
 36: 3. `yarn lint` zero errors
 37: 4. Tests pass
 38: 5. No secrets committed
 39: 6. WCAG 2.1 AA for new UI
 40: 
 41: ---
 42: 
 43: ## Next.js 16 Upgrade Notes (June 2026)
 44: 
 45: ### Breaking changes — know these before writing any frontend code
 46: 
 47: **Async params/searchParams/cookies/headers (enforced)**
 48: All must be awaited — synchronous access throws at runtime in v16.
 49: ```typescript
 50: // ALWAYS — v16 required
 51: const { id } = await props.params
 52: const { q } = await props.searchParams
 53: const store = await cookies()
 54: 
 55: // NEVER — throws at runtime in v16
 56: const { id } = props.params
 57: ```
 58: 
 59: Type helpers (run `yarn workspace @scholar-flow/frontend exec next typegen`):
 60: ```typescript
 61: // Page component
 62: export default async function Page(props: PageProps<'/papers/[id]'>) {
 63:   const { id } = await props.params
 64: }
 65: 
 66: // Layout component
 67: export default async function Layout(props: LayoutProps) {
 68:   const { id } = await props.params
 69: }
 70: 
 71: // API route
 72: export async function GET(req: Request, ctx: RouteContext) {
 73:   const { id } = await ctx.params
 74: }
 75: ```
 76: 
 77: **proxy.ts replaces middleware.ts**
 78: Auth guards are in proxy.ts (not middleware.ts).
 79: Read proxy.ts before any auth task.
 80: Never recreate middleware.ts.
 81: 
 82: **React Compiler is ON — no manual memoization**
 83: Do NOT add: useMemo, useCallback, React.memo()
 84: The compiler memoizes automatically.
 85: 
 86: **Caching APIs updated**
 87: ```typescript
 88: // Background revalidation
 89: revalidateTag('papers', 'max')
 90: 
 91: // Immediate update (user sees change instantly)
 92: updateTag('user-profile')
 93: 
 94: // Stable imports
 95: import { cacheLife, cacheTag } from 'next/cache'
 96: ```
 97: 
 98: **Lint command changed**
 99: Use: `eslint .`
100: Not: `next lint` (removed in v16)
101: 
102: **Images**
103: Use remotePatterns only — domains config removed.
