49:           ${{ steps.flow-check.outputs.error_message }}
50:           ### 📋 Correct Branch Flow
51:           The expected branch flow for this repository is:
52:           \`\`\`
53:           atik → dev → main
54:           \`\`\`
55:           ### ✅ Valid Flows
56:           - \`atik → dev\` (automatic via workflow)
57:           - \`dev → main\` (automatic via PR + auto-merge)
58:           - Feature branches → \`atik\` (manual PRs)
59:           ### 🚫 Invalid Flows (Blocked)
60:           - \`dev → atik\` (reverse flow)
61:           - \`main → dev\` (reverse flow)
62:           - \`main → atik\` (reverse flow)
63:           ### 🔧 How to Fix
64:           1. Close this PR
65:           2. If you need to sync changes, merge in the correct direction
66:           3. Create a new PR following the correct flow
67:           **This PR will be automatically closed to prevent reverse merging.**"
68:         env:
69:           GH_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.GH_TOKEN }}
70:       - name: Close invalid flow PR
71:         if: steps.flow-check.outputs.invalid_flow == 'true'
72:         run: |
73:           gh pr close ${{ github.event.pull_request.number }} \
74:             --comment "🚫 Automatically closing PR due to invalid branch flow. Please follow the correct flow: atik → dev → main"
75:         env:
