<file path="CLAUDE.md">
  1: # Scholar-Flow — Claude Quick Reference
  2: 
  3: ## Stack
  4: - **Frontend**: Next.js 16 App Router, React 19.2, TypeScript strict
  5: - **Auth**: better-auth (replaced NextAuth.js v4)
  6: - **State**: Redux Toolkit Query (RTK Query)
  7: - **UI**: Tailwind CSS v4 + shadcn/ui
  8: - **Backend**: Express.js, Prisma 7.8.0, PostgreSQL + pgvector
  9: - **Package Manager**: Yarn Berry v4.9.2
 10: - **Monorepo**: Turborepo v2.5.8
 11: 
 12: ## Commands
 13: ```bash
 14: # Development
 15: yarn dev:turbo           # Start both frontend (3000) and backend (5000)
 16: yarn dev:frontend        # Frontend only
 17: yarn dev:backend         # Backend only
 18: 
 19: # Build & Quality
 20: yarn build               # Production build (both)
 21: yarn type-check          # TypeScript check (both)
 22: yarn lint                # ESLint (both)
 23: yarn test                # Test suite
 24: yarn format              # Prettier
 25: 
 26: # Database
 27: yarn db:migrate          # Prisma migrate dev
 28: yarn db:generate         # Prisma generate --sql
 29: yarn db:studio           # Prisma Studio
 30: yarn db:seed             # Seed database
 31: 
 32: # Next.js 16 specific
 33: yarn workspace @scholar-flow/frontend exec next typegen  # Generate PageProps/LayoutProps
 34: ```
 35: 
 36: ## Next.js 16 Quick Reference
 37: **Async required:**
 38: - `await props.params`
 39: - `await props.searchParams`
 40: - `await cookies()`
 41: - `await headers()`
 42: 
 43: **Type helpers:**
 44: - `PageProps<'/path/[param]'>`
 45: - `LayoutProps`
 46: - `RouteContext`
 47: 
 48: **Auth file:** `proxy.ts` (NOT middleware.ts — renamed in v16)
 49: 
 50: **React Compiler ON:** Never add `useMemo`/`useCallback`/`memo()` manually
 51: 
 52: **Cache:**
 53: - `revalidateTag('tag', 'max')` — background revalidation
 54: - `updateTag('tag')` — immediate update
 55: - `refresh()` — refresh client router
 56: 
 57: **Stable imports:**
 58: ```typescript
 59: import { cacheLife, cacheTag } from 'next/cache'
 60: ```
 61: 
 62: **Turbopack:** Default for `next dev` and `next build` — no flags needed
 63: 
 64: ## Auth Architecture
 65: - **better-auth config**: `apps/frontend/src/lib/auth/better-auth.ts`
 66: - **Auth client**: `apps/frontend/src/lib/auth/authClient.ts`
 67: - **API route**: `apps/frontend/src/app/api/auth/[...auth]/route.ts`
 68: - **proxy.ts**: `apps/frontend/proxy.ts` (auth guards, replaces middleware.ts)
 69: - **Redux slice**: `apps/frontend/src/redux/auth/authSlice.ts`
 70: - **Backend auth**: JWT + bcrypt + refresh tokens (Express)
 71: 
 72: ## Critical Rules
 73: - NEVER use npm or pnpm — always yarn
 74: - NEVER import backend into frontend
 75: - NEVER use Prisma in frontend
 76: - NEVER expose AWS credentials in frontend
 77: - NEVER update subscription status from frontend
 78: - NEVER add console.log for debugging
 79: - NEVER call save on every TipTap keystroke
 80: - NEVER make raw fetch calls inside React components
 81: - NEVER skip Stripe webhook signature verification
 82: 
 83: ## File Structure
 84: ```
 85: apps/frontend/src/app/         → App Router pages
 86: apps/frontend/components/      → UI components
 87: apps/frontend/lib/             → Utilities, auth, API clients
 88: apps/frontend/redux/           → RTK Query slices
 89: apps/frontend/proxy.ts         → Auth guards
 90: apps/backend/src/app/          → Controllers, routes, middleware
 91: apps/backend/prisma/           → Schema + migrations
 92: ```
 93: 
 94: ## Current Phase
