 1: # Paper Module — Manual Browser Test Checklist
 2: 
 3: > Status: API-level E2E green (29/29 checks, `apps/backend/e2e_papers.cjs`) —
 4: > access lockdown, upload, extraction pipeline, semantic search, editor
 5: > versions, annotations. This checklist covers the browser-level walkthrough.
 6: >
 7: > Environment: local dev (frontend :3000, backend :5000). Stripe not needed.
 8: 
 9: ## Prep
10: 1. Backend + frontend running (`yarn dev:backend`, `yarn dev:frontend`).
11: 2. Login as `researcher@scholarflow.com` / `password123` (has a workspace),
12:    `pro.researcher@scholarflow.com` / `password123`, and an admin.
13: 3. Have a real PDF + a DOCX file handy (2-3 pages each).
14: 
15: ---
16: 
17: ## 1. Upload (`/dashboard/papers/upload`)
18: - [ ] File tab: drag & drop a PDF → "Uploading..." → "Uploaded — processing
19:       queued" (no fake stage timers) → **View** button opens the paper.
20: - [ ] Success toast only when uploads actually succeed; failed files show
21:       their error in the queue.
22: - [ ] Uploading without a workspace → error toast (workspace required).
23: - [ ] Tags + language fields are sent with the upload.
24: - [ ] DOI / arXiv / URL / Smart-URL imports still work and navigate to the
25:       paper.
26: - [ ] Uploading a file >50MB → rejected (multer cap).
27: 
28: ## 2. Paper list (`/dashboard/papers`)
29: - [ ] Workspace filter shows only workspaces you belong to.
30: - [ ] Cursor "Load More" pagination works.
31: - [ ] UPLOADED papers show a Process button; PROCESSING shows progress;
32:       FAILED shows Retry.
33: 
34: ## 3. Paper detail (`/dashboard/papers/[id]`)
35: - [ ] Processing status polls until PROCESSED (title/metadata appear).
36: - [ ] **Preview PDF** toggles the iframe; if the signed URL fails the error
37:       state shows instead of hanging.
38: - [ ] **Download original** (DOCX) downloads a file (no popup blocker).
39: - [ ] Edit metadata → save; **Generate with AI** fills title/abstract/tags
40:       AND persists them to the paper (not only the edit form).
41: - [ ] AI panels are **independently toggled**: Key Points / AI Summary /
42:       Insights / AI Tools — each opens alone.
43: - [ ] AI Summary: tone/audience/focus options; cached vs refreshed badges;
44:       model shown.
45: - [ ] Insights: model selector defaults to the first provider-catalog model
46:       (no hardcoded gemini); send → thread appears; history persists.
47: - [ ] **AI Tools (new)**: Rewrite (text or paper title, tone), Translate
48:       (target language), Compare (pick a second paper), Literature Review
49:       (optional topic) — each returns AI output rendered safely.
50: - [ ] Delete (confirm dialog) → back to list.
51: - [ ] Relations + Collaborate links work (collaborate = editor paper only).
52: 
53: ## 4. Search (`/dashboard/papers/search`)
54: - [ ] Query hits the **backend** global search (papers tab): title/author/
55:       tag/abstract matches, pagination, results from shared workspaces too.
56: - [ ] Empty/error states render properly.
57: 
58: ## 5. Semantic search (dashboard search or `/search/semantic`)
59: - [ ] A PROCESSED paper with chunks returns semantic hits for related
60:       queries (OpenAI key + USE_PGVECTOR=true).
61: - [ ] Workspace members can semantically search shared papers (uploader
62:       + workspace scope).
63: - [ ] Papers with no embeddings fall back gracefully (fallback flag), and
64:       the **hourly backfill sweep** re-embeds them (verify after ~1h or via
65:       `runEmbeddingBackfill()` directly).
66: 
67: ## 6. Annotations (`/dashboard/(modules)/research/annotations`)
68: - [ ] Open a paper → annotations load (auth required — anon gets 401).
69: - [ ] Highlight/underline/strikethrough + comments work; versions list works.
70: 
71: ## 7. Editor papers (collaborate / `/dashboard/papers/editor`)
72: - [ ] Create editor paper → auto-save → publish → versions list.
73: - [ ] Another user cannot read versions or content of your editor paper
74:       (403) — access is uploader/workspace-member only.
75: 
76: ## 8. Access control spot-checks (no login / wrong user)
77: - [ ] Logged OUT: direct visit to `/dashboard/papers/[id]` → redirected to
78:       login (401 API).
79: - [ ] Logged in as a DIFFERENT user: paper detail → 403-style "not found"
80:       error state; Preview/Download buttons never work for foreign papers.
81: - [ ] Deleting/editing a foreign paper is impossible from the UI.
82: - [ ] `/papers/dev/workspace` no longer exists (dev backdoor removed).
83: 
84: ---
85: 
86: ## Known non-issues / notes
87: - DOC files upload but extraction marks them FAILED ("DOC not supported —
88:   convert to DOCX") — by design; the upload UI accepts them, so expect the
89:   FAILED state for .doc.
90: - `ai-context/resolve` for an unauthorized paper returns an error without
91:   leaking content (by design).
92: - Embedding model is `EMBEDDING_MODEL` env (default text-embedding-3-small,
93:   1536 dims — changing dimension needs a column migration).
94: - Semantic search uses cosine `<=>` — matches the HNSW vector_cosine_ops index.
95: 
96: ## Sign-off gate
97: - [ ] All boxes pass.
98: - [ ] `yarn build`, `yarn lint` (0 errors), `yarn type-check` green.
99: - [ ] `node apps/backend/e2e_papers.cjs` → 29/29 PASSED.
