  1: # Payment & Subscription System — Manual Browser Test Checklist
  2: 
  3: > Status: API-level E2E is green (31/31 checks, `apps/backend/e2e_admin.cjs`).
  4: > This checklist covers the **browser-level** walkthrough that cannot be
  5: > automated — run it before declaring the system production-ready.
  6: >
  7: > Environment: local dev (frontend :3000, backend :5000) with **Stripe test
  8: > mode** (`sk_test_`). Never mix live keys.
