 10: ## Prep
 11: 
 12: 1. Backend running: `yarn dev:backend` (ts-node-dev hot-reloads).
 13: 2. Frontend running: `yarn dev:frontend`.
 14: 3. `stripe listen --forward-to http://localhost:5000/webhooks/stripe` in a
 15:    terminal; copy the printed `whsec_...` into `apps/backend/.env`
 16:    `STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET`, then restart the backend.
 17: 4. Stripe test cards:
 18:    - `4242 4242 4242 4242` — succeeds
 19:    - `4000 0000 0000 0002` — declines (for payment-failure tests)
