 57: - [ ] DB check: `User.role = PRO_RESEARCHER`, `Subscription` row ACTIVE with
 58:       `trialEnd` set, `WebhookEvent` checkout.session.completed = processed.
 59: - [ ] **Buy Team monthly** as a NEW free user → role becomes TEAM_LEAD,
 60:       TEAM_LEAD dashboard sections appear.
 61: - [ ] **Double-buy guard**: while a Pro subscription is ACTIVE, clicking a
 62:       paid plan CTA → error toast "You already have an active subscription"
 63:       (400 ALREADY_SUBSCRIBED) — never a second Stripe checkout.
 64: - [ ] `stripe trigger checkout.session.completed` → recorded as `failed`
 65:       ("Missing required metadata") but Stripe receives HTTP 200 (no retry
 66:       storm). This is expected for CLI fixtures.
 67: 
 68: ## 3. Billing page (`/dashboard/billing`) — all roles
 69: 
 70: - [ ] **RESEARCHER (free)**: shows Free plan, "Upgrade plan" button,
 71:       upgrade card.
 72: - [ ] **PRO_RESEARCHER / TEAM_LEAD**: NEVER shows "Upgrade plan" — always
 73:       "Manage Subscription" + "Explore plans". (Regression: this was the
 74:       "Pro plan shows upgrade plan" bug.)
 75: - [ ] **PAST_DUE state**: set the subscription past due (see §5 test card
 76:       `4000...0002`) → amber banner "Payment failed — access continues until
 77:       {grace date}", status badge "Past due", Manage button available.
 78: - [ ] **Canceled-at-period-end**: cancel in Stripe portal → rose card
 79:       "Subscription canceled — access continues until {date}".
 80: - [ ] Error state: stop the backend → billing page shows error card with
 81:       "Try again" (never silent FREE display).
