 83: ## 4. Stripe Customer Portal
 84: 
 85: - [ ] "Manage Subscription" opens the Stripe portal.
 86: - [ ] In portal: update payment method, cancel at period end, reactivate.
 87: - [ ] Return to the app → data refreshes (role/status/cancel state updated
 88:       within ~30s via polling).
 89: 
 90: ## 5. Payment failure / grace / downgrade (money-critical)
 91: 
 92: - [ ] Pro user, change card to `4000 0000 0000 0002` in portal, wait for
 93:       next charge attempt (or use `stripe trigger invoice.payment_failed`).
 94: - [ ] Notification bell shows "Payment failed" (SYSTEM notification).
 95: - [ ] DB: `Subscription.status = PAST_DUE`, a `Payment` row with
 96:       `status = FAILED` exists (failed-payments metric is no longer always 0).
