  1: h# ScholarFlow — SE Lab Presentation Speech Script
  2: 
  3: > **Simple words. Short sentences. Easy to remember.**
  4: > Each member's TOTAL speaking time = **2 to 2.5 minutes max**.
  5: > At non-native speaker pace (~90 words/min) — keep each slide to ~50–60 words.
  6: 
  7: ---
  8: 
  9: ## 👥 Member Assignment
 10: 
 11: | Order | Member     | Slides            | Topics                                              |
 12: | ----- | ---------- | ----------------- | --------------------------------------------------- |
