 14: | 2nd   | **Salman** | 5 · 6 · 7 · 8          | Scope, Features (1/2), Features (2/2), Benchmark    |
 15: | 3rd   | **Atikur** | 9 · 10 · 11            | Comparison, Tech Stack, Architecture                |
