 86: ### Slide 5 — Project Scope _(~35 sec)_
 87: 
 88: Thank you. Now let me explain what ScholarFlow will deliver.
 89: 
 90: We have **four modules**.
 91: 
 92: One — Paper Upload with AI metadata extraction, stored on AWS S3.
