116: Seven — Citation Generator — APA, MLA, IEEE, BibTeX automatically.
117: Eight — PDF Annotations — highlight, add notes, bookmark, share with team.
118: Nine — Analytics Dashboard — usage and activity charts.
119: Ten — Subscription Billing — Stripe, free and pro plans.
