278: 
279: ## 🗒️ Quick Tips for Non-Native Speakers
280: 
281: - **Speak slowly and clearly.** Pause after every point.
282: - **Use the slide as your guide.** Look at it, then say what it shows.
283: - **Don't memorize word-for-word.** Know the main idea — speak naturally.
284: - **If you forget a word — describe it simply.** Simple is always better.
285: - **Practice your section 3 times.** You will feel confident on the day.
286: - **Make eye contact with the audience** — not the screen.
