227: 
228: ### Content Management & Editing
229: 
230: - ✅ **Rich Text Editor**: TipTap-based, with advanced formatting, tables, lists, and image upload
231: - ✅ **Auto-save & Drafts**: Debounced auto-save, manual save, and draft/publish workflow
232: - ✅ **Export to PDF/DOCX**: One-click export with embedded images and professional styling
233: - ✅ **Image Upload**: Drag-and-drop or paste images, S3 storage, resizing
234: - ✅ **Email Sharing**: Share papers via email with permission management
235: 
236: ### Authentication & Security
237: 
238: - ✅ **Authentication System**: Google/GitHub OAuth + email/password
239: - ✅ **Production Security**: Rate limiting, monitoring, error handling, admin-only access
240: 
241: ### Paper Management
242: 
243: - ✅ **Paper Upload**: Multi-file drag-and-drop with S3 storage
244: - ✅ **Metadata Extraction**: AI-powered title, author, abstract extraction
245: - ✅ **Advanced Search**: Full-text search with comprehensive filters
246: - ✅ **PDF Preview**: Secure iframe-based PDF viewer
247: 
248: ### Admin & System Monitoring
249: 
250: - ✅ **Real-Time System Metrics**: Live CPU, memory, storage, database monitoring with 10s auto-refresh
251: - ✅ **Accurate CPU Tracking**: Intelligent calculation using Node.js os module (idle/total times)
252: - ✅ **Smart Storage Analytics**: Dynamic estimation (10x usage, min 100GB) for realistic percentages
253: - ✅ **Health Dashboard**: Auto-classified status cards (healthy/degraded/unhealthy/warning/critical)
254: - ✅ **Performance Visualization**: Auto-colored bars (green→blue→yellow→red based on values)
255: - ✅ **System Information**: Real-time platform, versions, memory, uptime display
256: 
257: ### User Experience
258: 
259: - ✅ **Dashboard**: Quick access and navigation with role-based routing
260: - ✅ **Responsive UI**: Mobile-first design with modern components
261: - ✅ **Lazy Loading**: Code splitting with React.lazy and Suspense boundaries
