426: ## Next.js 16 Specific Rules
427: 
428: ### Async Request APIs (Breaking change — fully enforced in v16)
429: params, searchParams, cookies(), headers(), draftMode()
430: are ALL async. Must always be awaited.
431: 
432:   CORRECT:
433:     const { id } = await props.params
434:     const store = await cookies()
435:     const list = await headers()
436: 
437:   NEVER:
438:     const { id } = props.params  (synchronous — removed in v16)
439:     const store = cookies()      (synchronous — removed in v16)
440: 
441: Type helpers (generated by next typegen):
442:   Page components:   PageProps<'/path/[param]'>
443:   Layout components: LayoutProps
444:   Route handlers:    RouteContext
445: 
446: ### Routing
447: middleware.ts is renamed to proxy.ts in this project.
448: The exported function is named proxy, not middleware.
449: NEVER recreate middleware.ts — use proxy.ts only.
450: matcher config in proxy.ts controls auth guards.
451: 
452: ### Auth — better-auth
453: better-auth replaces NextAuth.js v4.
454: Auth config: lib/auth/better-auth.ts
455: Auth client: lib/auth/authClient.ts (useSession, signIn, signOut)
456: API route: app/api/auth/[...auth]/route.ts
457: Session is managed by better-auth with backend sync via callbacks.
458: Redux authSlice persists the actual accessToken for backend API calls.
459: 
460: ### Caching APIs
461: revalidateTag now requires second argument:
462:   revalidateTag('papers', 'max')       — background revalidation
463:   updateTag('user-profile')            — immediate update (Server Actions)
464:   refresh()                            — refresh client router
465: 
466: Stable imports (no unstable_ prefix):
467:   import { cacheLife, cacheTag } from 'next/cache'
468: 
469: ### Turbopack (now default)
470: Turbopack is default for next dev and next build.
471: No --turbopack flag needed in scripts.
472: turbopack config is top-level in next.config.ts (not experimental).
473: Filesystem caching enabled: experimental.turbopackFileSystemCacheForDev
474: Dev output goes to .next/dev (not .next).
475: 
476: ### React 19.2 + React Compiler
477: React Compiler is enabled (reactCompiler: true in next.config.ts).
478: Do NOT add useMemo, useCallback, or memo() manually.
479: The compiler handles memoization automatically.
480: Adding manual memoization on top will cause double-memoization bugs.
