614: - Follow phase discipline strictly; see `Roadmap.md` before starting new features.
615: - Ship only in-phase work; defer out-of-scope requests unless they unblock the current milestone.
616: - Prefer shipping a thin vertical slice over broad incomplete scaffolding.
617: - Do NOT create README.md, OPTIMIZATION.md, CHANGELOG.md, or PERFORMANCE.md files for minor updates or every change.
618: - Inline documentation only; comments explain WHY not WHAT.
619: - Quality gates before merge:
